      "S5_customer_disclosure",
      "S2_thermal_testing"
     ],
     "excerpt": "A recall is mandatory when a model exceeds 10 thermal incidents per 100,000 installed units in a year",
     "comparison": "10 per 100k trigger is weaker than the 8 per 100k acceptable limit and benefits Halcyon; traded against Northwind's 7% S2 ceiling (m9)."
    }
   ],
